    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Buckley Real Estate are pleased to present this Pre63 Investment Property to the Dublin sales market. The property comprises of 11 self contained apartments laid out in a mixture of studios and one bedroom apartments. The property comes to the market in great condition throughout having been fully refurbished in 2023 with no expense spared and no stone left unturned. The property is currently fully tenanted and is achieving an annual rental income of €360,000 per annum, providing a 13% yield. \r\n\r\nLocated just on the central Dorset Street Upper, one of Dublin’s main travelling routes, the property is within walking distance of O’Connell Street, the Mater Hospital, and Dublin City Centre. The area benefits from a wide range of amenities, and strong tenant demand due to its proximity to the city centre, hospitals, colleges, and major employment hubs. The property is naturally located within a very well serviced public transport area with several bus routes services Dorset Street and surrounding streets. Dublin Airport is also within a 20 minute drive. \r\n\r\nWe expect this to be a popular listing and early viewing is strongly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "95 Dorset Street Upper is a prime 4 storey residential property comprising a mixture of studio apartments and one bedroom apartments. The entire property underwent an extensive refurbishment in 2023 and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. \r\n\r\nAll apartments have new flooring, fully fitted kitchens with all essential appliances, fully fitted bathrooms and comfortable living arrangements. \r\n\r\nUpon entrance to the property you are greeted by a large and welcoming entrance hallway, along with entrances to apartments 1 & 2. Apartments 3, 4 & 5 are located on the first floor with a storage room on the return. Apts 7, 8 and 9 are located on the third floor in a mirroring layout to the ones below. Finally on the top floor, apartments 9,10 and 11 are located."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Apt 1 (one bed) - 5.38m x 4.35m \r\nbedroom 3.65 x 3.54\nbathroom 2.38 x 1.55\nstorage 2.28 x 1.28\r\n\r\nApt 2 (studio) - 3.84m x 10.51m \r\nbathroom 1.45 x 0.94 \nstorage 1.03 x 2.74\r\n\r\nPatio - 3.54m x 3.09m \r\n\r\n\r\nApt 4 (studio) - 4.6m x 2.93m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.02 \r\n\r\nApt 5 (studio) - 3.7m x 3.93m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.02 \r\n\r\nApt 3 (studio) - 2.79m x 3.52m \r\n\r\n\r\nApt 6 (studio) - 2.79m x 3.52m \r\nbathroom 1.64 x 1.03\r\n\r\nApt 7 studio - 2.93m x 4.6m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.1\r\n\r\nApt 8 studio - 3.7m x 3.93m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.1\r\n\r\nApt 9 studio - 2.8m x 3.52m \r\nbathroom 1.64 x 1.03\r\n\r\nApt 10 studio - 2.93m x 4.6m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.1\r\n\r\nApt 11 studio - 3.7m x 3.93m \r\nbathroom 2.22 x 1.1\r\n\r\n"
      },
